<BaseLayout
  title="OSCAR: 2-bit KV Cache Without the Accuracy Cliff | AI/ML Deep Dives"
  description="How attention-aware covariance rotations make INT2 KV-cache quantization both accurate and deployable in production LLM serving."
  crumb="OSCAR INT2 KV Cache"
